# Trial-Size Trial by Water (outlands 148): the battlefield's scroll arm with the Scroll of Instant Warp already held. A
# SMN of level 20 with this quest accepted, the Mini Tuning Fork of Water and a Scroll of Instant Warp: the fork's
# trade to WP_Entrance, option 17 (index 1, arena 1), LEVIATHAN_PRIME_ASA-18 killed; 32001's finish: Leviathan learned
# (LEVIATHAN_UNLOCKED 0, 0, 2), the scroll held: none given, Norg fame +20, completed.
char zone=CloisterOfTides pos=557.5,35.1,563.0 job=SMN lvl=20
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByWater accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfWater
item ScrollOfInstantWarp
login
trade WP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfWater x1  # the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                    # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill LEVIATHAN_PRIME_ASA-18               # won, 32001 opens
finish                                    # Leviathan learned; the scroll held: none given; Norg fame +20; completed
